The Cannon for MUSE Sculptor abundances\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 This repository contains the notebooks and utilities used to train and apply 
\f0\b The Cannon
\f1\b0  to low-resolution MUSE spectra in order to estimate stellar labels and chemical abundances for stars in the Sculptor dwarf spheroidal galaxy (Cornejo-Cardenas et al. in prep.)\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

